 anuel\, Hensley is known for his other-worldly guitar playing\, jaw-droppi
 ng musicianship and soulful storytelling. Having recently announced his si
 gnature guitar with Taylor Guitars: The Trey Hensley Gold Label 510e\, Hen
 sley is set to release a new album\, Can’t Outrun The Blues\, on March 6
 \, 2026. The title cut has spent multiple weeks at #1 on the bluegrass cha
