DESCRIPTION:Join us for a presentation by Bonnie Bennett\, co-founder of K
 akawa Chocolate House (located next door to the museum). After explaining 
 a little about the fascinating history of chocolate\, Bennett will sit dow
 n for a conversation about the important role of sustainable production an
 d agroforestry with Jane Winchell\, the Sarah Fraser Robbins director of P
 EM’s Dotty Brown Art & Nature Center and coordinating curator for Knowin
 g Nature: Stories of the Boreal Forest. Join us afterwards for a special c
 hocolate demonstration and tasting! After the program\, be sure to visit K
 nowing Nature: Stories of the Boreal Forest on its last day.\n\nSources: N
 orth of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/event/sustainable-ch
 ocolate-with-kakawa-chocolate-house/
