SUMMARY:Nature Walk at the Shipyard
DTSTART:20261014T110000
DTEND:20261014T120000
DTSTAMP:20260922T160019Z
UID:9566b25d9811f3fedd82577edb960d@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Spend a Wednesday morning exploring the Essex shipyard and sur
 rounding salt marsh with EHSSM Education Coordinator Kaylee Stanton. Learn
  to identify local birds by sight and sound\, use tools like Merlin Bird I
 D\, and discover how the birds around us connect to the larger life of the
  estuary. All ages and experience levels welcome Perfect for homeschoolers
  and curious naturalists 15 participants max per session Free with admissi
 on Join us for one or all sessions to experience the marsh & birds through
  the fall. Essex Shipbuilding Museum 66 Main Street\, Essex\n\nSources: No
 rth of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/event/nature-walk-at-
 the-shipyard/2026-10-14/
