BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Rockport Harvest Fest 2026
DTSTART:20261017T110000
DTEND:20261017T170000
DTSTAMP:20260922T160019Z
UID:ac892283d5ae2232f059e21a8beae6@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Harvest Fest FALL INTO FUN: HARVEST\, GATHER\, CELEBRATE! The 
 Greater Cape Ann Chamber of Commerce is excited to bring back this cherish
 ed community event! We invite you to join us by the shore for a unique ble
 nd of fall festivities and coastal charm\, where the crisp sea breeze meet
 s the warmth of community spirit. Come enjoy Rockport’s local charm and 
 bountiful harvest while you explore the scenic downtown and immerse yourse
 lf in festive seasonal activities. Whether you’re a longtime local or ju
 st visiting\, this is the perfect way to experience the magic of autumn by
  the sea. So\, grab your sweater and your loved ones\, and join us for a d
 ay of seaside celebration! Event Highlights Hometown Entertainment: Enjoy 
 live performances from local musicians and entertainers throughout the day
 . Local Vendors: Discover unique artisan goods and seasonal treats. Family
  Fun: Bring the kids and explore seasonal crafts\, face painting and a liv
 e animal exhibit! Seaside Bites and Brews: Savor seasonal favorites\, loca
 l cuisine and beer. Bake-Off: Come cheer on local bakers as they compete f
 or the title of Best Apple Pie! Shopping: Enjoy the rich artistic culture 
 and plentiful selections of our local retailers *Featured musical entertai
 nment from Headlands and Corey Wrinn Music *Apple Pie Bake Off – Come ch
 eer on amateur bakers as they compete for the title of best apple pie! Wan
 t to test your baking skills? Reach out to Colleen at colleen@capeannchamb
 er.com *Local craft beer from Rockport Brewing Co *Food provided by Meat &
  Sweet Foods and Rockport Brewing (more food vendors coming soon!)\, plus 
 don’t forget all the local favorite spots – whether your looking for a
