DTEND:20261024T210000
DTSTAMP:20260922T160019Z
UID:6e468f8d52e4178871ee9fe9d5bfe0@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:A night of fun\, games\, and drinks! Fire pits – indoor & ou
 tdoor shenanigans Have a great time while supporting a great cause! Ticket
 s $100 Open Bar – Bountiful bites\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent pag
