DTEND:20261107T170000
DTSTAMP:20260922T160019Z
UID:620110420f102f4fbb22f392ed821f@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Save the Date for the return of From the Deep: A Downtown Glou
 cester Arts Party on Saturday\, November 7 from 11:00 am – 5:00 pm. Duri
 ng our first part on May 2\, over 500 people came downtown to participate 
 in over 30 free cultural offerings presented by 45 different artists and c
 ultural organizations across the district.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEv
