UID:a738cbdd9caf8254075cbecb5fface@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Manchester-by-the-Sea’s Annual Holiday Stroll and other fun 
 events on December 4th… The Manchester Holiday Stroll & Business Open Ho
 use: 3 PM – 8 PM |Downtown Manchester. Stroll around town\, enjoy refres
 hments at many shops. Details will be available at participating local bus
 inesses.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.or
 g/event/holiday-stroll-manchester-by-the-sea-2026/
LOCATION:Downtown Manchester\, 10 Central Street\, Manchester-By-The-Sea\,
  MA\, 01944
